# Superseded by dashboard/data/sessions/<workflow_id>/ below - these fixed
# paths are no longer written to (each run now gets its own subdirectory,
# so concurrent users don't collide), left ignored in case any local
# working copy still has stale files at the old locations.
dashboard/data/workflow_checkpoints.sqlite
dashboard/data/memory/
dashboard/data/technical_trader_diagnostics/

# Per-run session data (one subdirectory per workflow_id): checkpoint DB,
# Memory store, diagnostics, and exported snapshot. Runtime state, not
# source - and workflow_id-specific to whoever ran it.
dashboard/data/sessions/
